        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ketigid\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ketigid:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Or it can still receive the 'destroy' action but the When Destroyed trigger will not happen just like redirection triggers only happen once?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This, I think.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And there may be a general rule here – triggered effects can't be triggered more than once for the same 'action', where 'action' is defined as a card play (including villain/env cards), power use, or card draw.</p>",
